  "content": "[Intro]\n[Bsus2]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Bsus2]A butter-\nfly sailed on the\n[E5]breeze\n[G]Past a field\n[Em6/G]of barbed wire\n[F#sus4]trees\n[F#]\n[Bsus2]Where golden\ndragons chased around\n[E5]\n[G]Pampered\n[Em6/G]poppies on the ground\n[F#sus4]\n[F#]\n\n[Chorus]\n[D]Two silver\n[F#m]trout sat way on\n[Bm]high\n[G]\n[D]And watched a\n[F#m]royal samurai\n[Bm]\n[G]\n[D]Plant two black\n[F#m]orchids in the a\n[Bm]box\n[G]\n[D]And strap it\n[F#m]to a laughing fox\n[Bm]\n[G]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Bm]A minstrel\nbought a crooked\n[E5]spoon\n[Bm]He gave it to\na blue ba-\n[E5]boon\n[Bm]Who filled it\nfull of virgin\n[E5]snow\nAnd\n[G]wan dered in\n[A]the afterglow\n[Bsus2]\n[Bm]\n\n[Intrelude]\n[Bsus2]\n[E5]\n[G]\n[Em6/G]\n[F#sus4]\n[F#]\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Bsus2]A toad stood\nin his ballet\n[E5]shoes\n[G]Teaching\n[Em6/G]sixteen kangaroos\n[F#sus4]\n[F#]\n[Bsus2]How to\nskip across a lake\n[E5]\n[G]They found it\n[Em6/G]hard to stay a\n[F#sus4]wake\n[F#]\n\n[Solo 1]\n[Bsus2]\n[E5]\n[G]\n[Em6/G]\n[F#sus4]\n[F#]\n\n[Chorus]\n[D]A pharaoh\n[F#m]played a merry\n[Bm]tune\n[G]\n[D]And watched nine\n[F#m]cats dance on the moon\n[Bm]\n[G]\n[D]I didn't\n[F#m]know what all this\n[Bm]meant\n[G]\n[D]I didn't\n[F#m]know why I was\n[Bm]sent\n[G]\n\n[Solo 2]\n[Bm]\n[E5]\n[Bm]\n[E5]\n[Bm]\n[E5]\n[G]\n[A]\n[Bm]\n\n[Outro]\n[Bm]\n[E5]\n[Bm]\n[E5]\n[Bm]\n[E5]\n[G]\n[A]\n[Bm]",
